r.aB(0,"Debug",new A.blS(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/components/debug_example.dart","    In this example we show what you will see when setting `debugMode = true`\n    and add the `FPSTextComponent` to your game.\n    This is a non-interactive example.\n  ")
r.aB(0,"ClipComponent",new A.blX(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/components/clip_component_example.dart","Tap on the objects to increase their size and see how the clip component\nworks.")
r.aB(0,"Component Pool",new A.blY(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/components/component_pool_example.dart","Tap on the screen to spawn a burst of pooled balls. Watch the stats to see active vs pooled balls and observe how the pool efficiently reuses objects.")
